{"id":"vod_sn_38464","vodId":"38464","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"如果烧陶的话也做个马克杯吧","name_cn":"如果烧陶的话也做个马克杯吧","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/57a63283b9c5f9931f23162b62612981.jpg"},"summary":"丰川姬乃（田中美海 配音）的母亲在她很小的时候就去世了，这么多年来，她一直和父亲过着相依为命的日子。这一天，姬乃跟随着父亲搬家来到了母亲的故乡岐阜县多治见市，不仅如此，姬乃还即将进入母亲曾经就读过的学校念书，这让姬乃感到非常的兴奋。　　在同班同学梨三华（芹泽优 配音）的邀请之下，姬乃来到了陶艺社中，在这里，她第一次得知，原来母亲生前是一名非常优秀的陶艺家。就这样，姬乃一头扎入了陶土和火焰的世界之中，出生于陶艺世家，被自己的身份所困扰着的青木十子（本泉莉奈 配音）、个性活泼开朗，对姬乃充满了好奇心的成濑直子（若井友希 配音），在这里，姬乃结识了许多志同道合的朋友。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dS5t8izNff1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cvvRiR0Feb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FapAhKrNsK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wJqWEMvWUB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bAzFsfMGEK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6YrdvmMjAb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aky2eB91MC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AQ5wRLunJ01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CYZVNpFt141/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AVWxrtA80G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pfVEivpthp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r9pWZT15rC1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.553Z"}